# Work Context Architecture

## 1. Overview: 4-Layer Architecture

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "Layer 1: CLI Entry"
        CLI[WorkContextCommand]
        Args[args: file-path]
    end

    subgraph "Layer 2: Data Collection"
        SymbolDB[(Symbol DB)]
        FileParser[File Parser<br/>@doc tags]
        DepQuery[Dependency Query]
        TestQuery[Test Query]
        UsageQuery[Usage Query]
    end

    subgraph "Layer 3: Data Sources"
        Symbols[symbols table]
        Dependencies[dependencies table]
        TestMappings[test_mappings table]
        DocFiles[managed/** docs]
    end

    subgraph "Layer 4: Validation & Display"
        Validator[Validation<br/>file exists check]
        Formatter[Formatter<br/>colored output]
        Summary[Summary<br/>aggregation]
    end

    CLI -->|1. resolve path| Args
    Args -->|2. load| SymbolDB
    SymbolDB -->|3. query| Symbols
    SymbolDB -->|4. query| Dependencies
    SymbolDB -->|5. query| TestMappings
    Args -->|6. parse| FileParser
    FileParser -->|7. search| DocFiles

    Symbols -->|8. build context| DepQuery
    Dependencies -->|9. resolve deps| DepQuery
    TestMappings -->|10. resolve tests| TestQuery
    Dependencies -->|11. reverse query| UsageQuery

    DepQuery -->|12. validate| Validator
    TestQuery -->|13. validate| Validator
    UsageQuery -->|14. validate| Validator
    DocFiles -->|15. resolve paths| Validator

    Validator -->|16. format| Formatter
    Formatter -->|17. aggregate| Summary
    Summary -->|18. display| CLI

