## 5. Database Query Pattern

```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph "Input"
        FilePath[file path<br/>src/foo.ts]
    end

    subgraph "Query 1: Get Symbols"
        Q1[SELECT * FROM symbols<br/>WHERE file_path = ?]
        R1[Result: Symbol[]]
    end

    subgraph "Query 2: Get Dependencies"
        Q2[SELECT * FROM dependencies<br/>WHERE symbol_id IN ...]
        R2[Result: Dep[]]
        Q2_2[SELECT * FROM symbols<br/>WHERE id = target]
        R2_2[Resolve: Dep.name]
    end

    subgraph "Query 3: Get Tests"
        Q3[SELECT * FROM test_mappings<br/>WHERE symbol_id IN ...]
        R3[Result: TestMapping[]]
    end

    subgraph "Query 4: Get Usage"
        Q4[SELECT * FROM dependencies<br/>WHERE target IN ...]
        R4[Result: Usage[]]
        Q4_2[SELECT * FROM symbols<br/>WHERE id = symbol_id]
        R4_2[Resolve: Usage.name]
    end

    subgraph "Output"
        Context[WorkContext]
    end

    FilePath -->|param| Q1
    Q1 -->|rows| R1
    R1 -->|symbol_ids| Q2
    Q2 -->|deps| R2
    R2 -->|target_ids| Q2_2
    Q2_2 -->|names| R2_2
    R1 -->|symbol_ids| Q3
    Q3 -->|mappings| R3
    R1 -->|symbol_ids| Q4
    Q4 -->|usages| R4
    R4 -->|symbol_ids| Q4_2
    Q4_2 -->|names| R4_2

    R1 & R2_2 & R3 & R4_2 -->|merge| Context

    classDef input fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#0277bd
    classDef query fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f57f17
    classDef result fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#2e7d32
    classDef output fill:#ce93d8,stroke:#6a1b9a

    class FilePath input
    class Q1,Q2,Q2_2,Q3,Q4,Q4_2 query
    class R1,R2,R2_2,R3,R4,R4_2 result
    class Context output
```

## 6. File System Interaction

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "Input Validation"
        CheckTarget[fs.existsSync<br/>target file]
        CheckDB[fs.existsSync<br/>.tsdoc/symbols.db]
    end

    subgraph "File Parsing"
        ReadFile[fs.readFileSync<br/>read target file]
        ParseDoc[Regex parse<br/>@doc tags]
    end

    subgraph "Document Discovery"
        SearchDirs[managed/features<br/>managed/workflows<br/>managed/concepts<br/>managed/architecture]
        ScanRecursive[fs.readdirSync<br/>recursive scan]
        ReadDoc[fs.readFileSync<br/>read each .md]
        MatchH1[Regex match<br/>H1: # [[Symbol]]]
    end

    subgraph "Dependency Validation"
        CheckDeps[fs.existsSync<br/>check dep file paths]
        CheckTests[fs.existsSync<br/>check test file paths]
    end

    subgraph "Path Resolution"
        Resolve[path.resolve<br/>absolute paths]
        Relative[path.relative<br/>display paths]
        Join[path.join<br/>construct paths]
    end

    CheckTarget -->|pass| CheckDB
    CheckDB -->|pass| ReadFile
    ReadFile -->|content| ParseDoc
    ParseDoc -->|symbol refs| SearchDirs
    SearchDirs -->|scan| ScanRecursive
    ScanRecursive -->|.md files| ReadDoc
    ReadDoc -->|content| MatchH1
    MatchH1 -->|match| Relative

    CheckDeps -->|validation| Resolve
    CheckTests -->|validation| Resolve
    Resolve -->|absolute| Join
    Join -->|relative| Relative

    classDef validation fill:#ffccbc,stroke:#d84315
    classDef parse fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f57f17
    classDef discover fill:#c5e1a5,stroke:#558b2f
    classDef check fill:#b3e5fc,stroke:#0277bd
    classDef path fill:#d1c4e9,stroke:#512da8

    class CheckTarget,CheckDB validation
    class ReadFile,ParseDoc parse
    class SearchDirs,ScanRecursive,ReadDoc,MatchH1 discover
    class CheckDeps,CheckTests check
    class Resolve,Relative,Join path
```

